OL,4,CJoanna Page says male actor made       
OL,5,C'awful' and 'inappropriate' comments   
OL,6,Cto her on set                          
OL,7,GJoanna Page has said she was subjected 
OL,8,Gto "really inappropriate" and "awful"  
OL,9,Gcomments from a fellow actor while on  
OL,10,Gset.                                   
OL,12,FThe Swansea-born actress, 48, told     
OL,13,Fcampmates on ITV's I'm a Celebrity...  
OL,14,FGet Me Out of Here! that the unnamed   
OL,15,Fmale actor had whispered "awful stuff" 
OL,16,Fin her ear before a scene.             
